\r\nimport { esbuildCommonjs } from '@originjs/vite-plugin-commonjs'\r\n\r\nexport default {\r\n    optimizeDeps:{\r\n    esbuildOptions:{\r\n      plugins:[\r\n        esbuildCommonjs(['react-calendar','react-date-picker']) \r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n#### Options\r\n\r\n- `include: string[]`\r\n  Dependent modules need to be transform.\r\n","readmeFilename":"README.md"}